  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">vatten &amp; sanitet SWSP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">water &amp; sanitation SWSP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Vatten- och Sanitetssektorn i Uganda 2003-2008 (SWSP) med totalt 255 MSEK, senare minskat till 150 MSEK. Sida har gett st&#xf6;d till sektorn sedan mitten av 1980-talet, men med SWSP s&#xe5; ges st&#xf6;det i form av sektorprogramst&#xf6;d i en SWAP sektor. St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r  sektor&#xf6;vergripande, men Sveriges uppf&#xf6;ljning har koncentrerats till ruralt vatten och sektorreformer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Support to Water and Sanitation Sector (SWSP) is for the period 2003-2008, with a total of 255 MSEK, later decreased to 150 MSEK. Sida has supported the sector since the mid 1980&apos;s, but with the SWSP the support is provided in the form of sector program support in a SWAP approach. The support encompasses the whole sector but Sida has concentrated its follow up on the rural sub-sector + sector reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
